That very last sentence was important.  Your problem is due to an
odd/still-not-solved build issue by Bioconductor for this particular
version of OSX.  The solution is to install the following version of
affxparser:

  https://groups.google.com/forum/#!topic/aroma-affymetrix/lEfDanThLEA/discussion

See if that works for you.

Sorry for the mess - trust me - we all like this irritating problem to
go away once and for all.

/Henrik

